Package: recodeStudio
Title: Interactive String-Variable Recoding Studio (Shiny)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Amelia", "Miramonti", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "amelia.miramonti@gmail.com")
Description: A dataset-agnostic Shiny application for cleaning messy string
    variables. Load any CSV or Excel file, browse unique values alphabetically
    or as string-similarity clusters, spellcheck with Hunspell, build recode
    rules with optional sibling-column propagation, and export a canonical
    recode CSV plus a runnable dplyr script. The app never modifies the source
    data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
